3.1.1 reservation and navigation -activity diagram uml
@startuml
|User|
start
:Open app or website;
:Log in to account;
:View available chargers on map;
:Select an available charger;

|System|
:Validate charger availability;
:Display charger details and reservation option;

|User|
if (Reserve charger?) then (yes)
  :Enter reservation duration (≤ 60 min);
  :Confirm reservation request;

  |System|
  :Record reservation in database;
  :Update charger status to "Reserved";
  :Generate reservation ID;
  :Display reservation confirmation;
else (no)
  :Skip reservation;
endif

if (Open navigation?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Generate Google Maps deep link;
  :Redirect user to Google Maps for navigation;
else (no)
  :Stay within provider app;
endif

|User|
:View confirmation and reservation details;
stop
@enduml

    3.1.1 alternate flow 
    @startuml
|User|
start
:Open app or website;
:Log in to account;
:View chargers on map;
:Select available charger;
:Skip reservation;
|System|
:Display "Navigate to charger" option;
if (User opens navigation?) then (yes)
  :Generate Google Maps link;
  :Redirect to navigation app;
else (no)
  :Stay on charger info screen;
endif
stop
@enduml

3.1.4 Historry & Statistics Use Case Activity Diagram
@startuml
start
:Enter login credentials;
:Click on login;

if (Login success?) then (YES)
  :Click View Statistics/History;
  :History & Statistics Page;
  
  if (Payment History or Statistics?) then 
    :Click Payment History;
    :View by Order/Property;
  else 
    :Click Statistics;
    if (Statistics Type?) then 
      :Money/Month & kW/Month;
    else 
      :Average cost of kWh/Month (for user's transactions onlly);
    endif
  endif

repeat
    
    :Select Time Period;
    
    if (Valid Period?) then (YES)
        :Click Show Results;
    else (NO)
        :Show Invalid Period Error;
        ' No 'stop' here, so it falls through to the loop check
    endif

repeat while (Update Time Period?) is (YES)
-> NO;
	:Finished & Exit;
stop

else (NO)
  :Show Login Error;
  stop
endif
@enduml


